WEBVTT

00:10.990 --> 00:15.360
Present

01:23.930 --> 01:25.680
Here I come!

01:25.680 --> 01:27.390
Jump!

01:28.640 --> 01:31.570
It must be nice to be a kid. They're so lively.

01:32.640 --> 01:35.350
This winter wind is piercing my body.

01:35.350 --> 01:37.480
If you're cold, move about.

01:37.480 --> 01:39.410
You haven't swept that area at all.

01:39.410 --> 01:42.560
But when it's this cold, I don't feel like doing anything.

01:42.560 --> 01:43.990
And every time I say something, you have an answer for it.

01:43.990 --> 01:47.370
Everyone, the roasted potatoes are done!

01:47.370 --> 01:49.080
Coming!

01:50.230 --> 01:53.310
This sweetness that gradually spreads throughout your mouth...

01:53.310 --> 01:55.550
Roasted potatoes are definitely a must have in the winter!

01:55.850 --> 01:57.220
Why you...

01:57.220 --> 01:59.470
Come and have some too, Kanata. The roasted potatoes-

01:59.470 --> 02:00.620
What's wrong?

02:00.620 --> 02:02.050
Did you choke?

02:02.050 --> 02:04.180
It's because you're so greedy that-

02:04.180 --> 02:05.750
N-No, that's not it...

02:05.750 --> 02:07.520
Kanata-san, behind you. Behind you!

02:13.650 --> 02:15.480
Roasted potatoes...

02:15.480 --> 02:17.710
Ah! It's one of the Waru Waru Gang!

02:17.710 --> 02:20.750
I bet she's here to kidnap Ruu again!

02:20.750 --> 02:23.030
But it's still strange, right?

02:24.620 --> 02:27.620
I-I'm so hungry...

02:30.040 --> 02:35.050
The Kicked-Out Guava's Love

02:35.050 --> 02:36.140
What?!

02:36.140 --> 02:38.510
You got kicked out of the Waru Waru Gang?

02:38.510 --> 02:42.350
Yup. I was working really hard as the Waru Waru Gang's mascot girl,

02:42.350 --> 02:49.770
when they suddenly told me, "You! Get out of here now!"

02:49.770 --> 02:51.830
You were the mascot girl?

02:51.830 --> 02:53.660
This is the first I've heard of it.

02:53.660 --> 02:55.750
Putting that aside...

02:55.750 --> 03:01.970
Basically, you were wandering around hungrily when you smelled the scent of freshly roasted potatoes,

03:01.970 --> 03:04.570
and without thinking, followed the smell here.

03:04.570 --> 03:05.700
Is that what happened?

03:05.700 --> 03:06.660
Yup.

03:06.660 --> 03:07.700
I see.

03:07.700 --> 03:09.540
It must've been tough for you.

03:09.540 --> 03:13.420
We have a lot of roasted potatoes, so eat as many as you want.

03:14.530 --> 03:15.630
Thank you!

03:17.630 --> 03:19.090
You're naïve, aren't you, Oba-tan?

03:19.090 --> 03:20.540
Naïve?

03:20.540 --> 03:22.380
Your opponent is the Waru Waru Gang.

03:22.380 --> 03:25.500
An evil secret organization that's bent on world domination.

03:25.500 --> 03:27.330
You can't let your guard down!

03:27.330 --> 03:31.690
W-We're not really bent on world domination...

03:32.620 --> 03:38.870
They might be trying to get us to drop our guard, so that they can kidnap Ruu-chama again!

03:38.870 --> 03:42.520
N-No, I'm not a member of the Waru Waru Gang anymore.

03:42.520 --> 03:44.570
There's no way I'd do something that evil.

03:44.570 --> 03:47.720
You might not, but then that's no guarantee that you wouldn't give in to temptation

03:47.720 --> 03:51.750
and kidnap Ruu in order to return to the Waru Waru Gang.

03:52.350 --> 03:55.550
They're suspicious. They're suspicious of me...

03:55.550 --> 03:59.760
Maybe this plan was impossible from the very beginning.

04:01.830 --> 04:07.970
Now, the time's finally ripe to put our ultimate secret plan into action.

04:07.970 --> 04:10.330
Our ultimate secret plan?

04:10.330 --> 04:15.630
According to my research, Earthlings are weak against sob stories.

04:15.630 --> 04:17.340
But what are the candles for?

04:17.340 --> 04:18.180
Now, listen here!

04:18.180 --> 04:22.500
Lie about being kicked out of the Waru Waru Gang to get close to them.

04:22.500 --> 04:27.050
Once their guard is totally down, kidnap the baby from the planet Otto,

04:27.050 --> 04:32.700
then sell him to a variety show on the planet Sharak as a rare flying baby.

04:32.700 --> 04:35.380
And we'll be rich!

04:35.380 --> 04:40.750
The plan's called "They didn't seem like someone who would do something so evil plan."

04:40.750 --> 04:44.630
Crushing someone's goodwill like that... Surely there's a limit to being bad?

04:44.630 --> 04:45.660
Shut up!

04:45.660 --> 04:51.020
As people who covered planet Sharak in slime using a giant frog, there's nothing for us to be afraid of.

04:51.020 --> 04:53.900
Well, I'm leaving the rest to you.

04:53.900 --> 04:55.360
What?! Me?! Again?!

04:55.360 --> 04:56.480
Of course.

04:56.480 --> 04:59.590
Out of all of us, you're the only one who's sympathizing with them.

04:59.610 --> 05:01.530
[Note: Please don't feed.]

05:01.530 --> 05:06.130
Hey, I get the plan, but why do<i> we have to go this far?</i>

05:06.130 --> 05:07.310
You're so stupid.

05:07.310 --> 05:09.520
It's to gain their sympathy of course.

05:09.520 --> 05:13.730
It's more realistic if your face looks gaunt.

05:13.730 --> 05:16.870
Hang in there, Guava. And that's why you<i> won't be eating for the next three days.</i>

05:16.870 --> 05:18.380
So mean!

05:18.380 --> 05:23.750
So mean. Doria-neechan and Kiwi-neechan always

05:23.750 --> 05:29.470
force me to do the bothersome chores like cleaning the toilet and weeding.

05:29.910 --> 05:36.270
Well, it's true I'm not as smart as Doria-neechan or capable like Kiwi-neechan, but...

05:33.880 --> 05:35.510
What's wrong with her?

05:35.510 --> 05:37.810
She's muttering about something to do with a toilet.

05:36.270 --> 05:42.880
But... but... I've had enough of being used and abused by my sisters!

05:42.880 --> 05:47.470
Well, we're only children, so we don't really understand...

05:47.470 --> 05:51.210
But being the youngest in a family does seem to come with its own burdens.

05:51.210 --> 05:54.080
Shall we let her stay with us until she knows what she's going to do?

05:54.080 --> 05:58.210
That's right. If she stays outside in this cold weather, she'll catch a cold.

05:58.210 --> 05:59.620
R-Really? I can?

05:59.620 --> 06:02.870
But you can't enter Ruu's room, no matter what.

06:02.870 --> 06:05.550
Okay! Yay! Yay!

06:05.550 --> 06:10.040
The first phase of the plan is a complete success.

06:10.040 --> 06:15.910
If things continue to go this well, I'll be able to kidnap baby Ruu easily!

06:19.980 --> 06:22.230
Wh-What's this?

06:22.230 --> 06:25.660
What are you talking about? It's breakfast, of course.

06:25.660 --> 06:28.200
I tried my very best to make it.

06:28.200 --> 06:30.120
Now, please hurry and eat it.

06:31.470 --> 06:36.270
Kiwi-neechan said that "a mother's cooking" would help make the enemy drop their guard.

06:36.270 --> 06:40.710
I'll cook and show them what a good person I am.

06:40.710 --> 06:43.810
Sorry! I'm on class duty today, so I've got to leave now.

06:43.810 --> 06:44.790
Me too!

06:44.790 --> 06:45.130
What?

06:47.610 --> 06:50.720
At least have some of the miso soup!

06:51.610 --> 06:53.690
Even though I went through all that trouble of making it...

06:58.270 --> 06:59.990
I'm hungry...

06:59.990 --> 07:02.400
Skipping breakfast is tough.

07:02.400 --> 07:06.830
And to top it all off, we were in such a rush we forgot our lunches.

07:06.830 --> 07:10.360
I hope Guava's not planning on doing that every morning.

07:10.360 --> 07:15.620
You've got to be kidding. Even your cooking is better than that.

07:15.620 --> 07:18.730
Why thank you. Hey, what do you mean by that?!

07:19.460 --> 07:23.130
If you like, please eat my lunch.

07:23.130 --> 07:26.950
Oh! You're really thoughtful. Thanks!

07:26.950 --> 07:34.040
Oh, no. I thought this might happen, so I prepare you a lunch every day just in case.

07:34.040 --> 07:39.890
Don't worry about it. It takes the same time to make two lunches instead of one.

07:39.890 --> 07:44.770
I hope you'll like my love-filled lunch.

07:44.770 --> 07:48.610
You can't, Kanata-san. You shouldn't eat other people's lunches.

07:48.610 --> 07:50.500
G-Guava.

07:50.500 --> 07:52.140
Why?

07:52.140 --> 07:55.090
You both forgot your lunches, didn't you?

07:55.090 --> 07:58.110
Here, it's Guava's special handmade lunch!

07:58.850 --> 08:01.290
Huh? Have we met you before somewhere?

08:01.290 --> 08:02.810
Yes, yes. I'm sure it was-

08:04.090 --> 08:05.500
Haven't we mentioned it before?

08:05.500 --> 08:08.110
This is Guava-san. She's just moved near us.

08:08.630 --> 08:10.280
What an unusual name.

08:10.280 --> 08:11.990
She's a foreign exchange student.

08:11.990 --> 08:13.010
Really?

08:13.010 --> 08:14.290
That's right.

08:14.290 --> 08:17.070
Kanata-san is very popular, right?

08:17.070 --> 08:22.330
It's not surprising that a girl would specially come from overseas just to bring him lunch.

08:22.330 --> 08:25.390
And the love-filled lunch that I made especially for him

08:25.390 --> 08:32.160
is fated to enter my stomach without being eaten by Kanata-kun again.

08:32.160 --> 08:35.070
Now, eat up both of you.

08:38.120 --> 08:40.580
Oh no! The side dish!

08:42.000 --> 08:43.930
Is this your side dish?

08:43.930 --> 08:46.710
Yes! Thank you!

08:46.710 --> 08:50.100
Don't be sad that your side dish decided to run away,

08:50.100 --> 08:53.700
because if you're sad, my roses will wither too.

08:55.050 --> 08:56.590
Who are you?

08:56.940 --> 09:00.240
I'm the spreader of love, Hikarigaoka Nozomu.

09:00.800 --> 09:03.350
I'm pleased to meet you, Mademoiselle.

09:03.350 --> 09:05.810
Goodbye, Mademoiselle~

09:06.890 --> 09:08.480
The prince!

09:08.480 --> 09:10.100
Prince?

09:10.600 --> 09:14.280
To be able to meet him again in a place like this!

09:14.280 --> 09:16.360
You know him?

09:16.360 --> 09:19.330
Yes, it was three days ago.

09:19.340 --> 09:22.660
It was while I was selling one of Doria-neechan's inventions...

09:24.710 --> 09:29.920
He was the one who kindly stretched out his hand to us when we were in trouble.

09:30.510 --> 09:32.300
This rose is for you.

09:32.300 --> 09:37.800
The prince then went on to help us with our peddling.

09:37.800 --> 09:41.880
We didn't really sell much, but I was so happy

09:41.880 --> 09:45.550
that even on Earth there are such nice people.

09:45.550 --> 09:46.890
"Even on Earth"?

09:48.020 --> 09:52.780
She means he's the nicest guy on Earth, right?

09:52.780 --> 09:54.010
Y-Yeah!

09:54.820 --> 09:56.780
It must be love.

09:56.780 --> 09:58.250
Love?

09:58.250 --> 10:01.740
She's fallen in love with Hikarigaoka-kun.

10:01.740 --> 10:05.000
I'm... i-in love?

10:06.750 --> 10:08.240
It seems like it's true.

10:08.240 --> 10:10.420
All right! Go for it!

10:10.430 --> 10:12.310
We'll cheer for you!

10:12.310 --> 10:13.420
H-Hey...

10:13.420 --> 10:15.120
Thank you, everyone!

10:15.120 --> 10:16.920
You have to attack! Attack!

10:16.920 --> 10:20.680
But my mind goes blank when I see him.

10:17.690 --> 10:21.710
Shouldn't she first be worrying more about how to make up with her sisters than of love?

10:20.680 --> 10:23.350
I wonder what kind of girls Hikarigaoka-kun likes.

10:21.710 --> 10:23.350
I think so too...

10:23.720 --> 10:28.910
Miyu-san! Please ask him what type of girl he likes!

10:30.740 --> 10:33.360
Um... Hey, Nozomu-kun.

10:33.360 --> 10:35.440
What's your ideal girl like?

10:35.440 --> 10:37.190
My ideal girl?

10:37.550 --> 10:41.850
Let's see... Long hair that's silky and straight.

10:41.850 --> 10:47.850
Of a medium height, likes children, and is always taking care of her younger brother.

10:47.850 --> 10:50.870
She has to be a kind, bright, family-orientated girl.

10:50.870 --> 10:53.290
A-Are you possibly talking about...

10:53.290 --> 10:56.380
Hey, Hikarigaoka-kun, what's your ideal girl like?

10:56.380 --> 11:01.590
A tall, short-haired, outgoing girl who loves sports perhaps?

11:01.950 --> 11:03.810
What do you look for in a girl, Hikarigaoka-kun?

11:03.810 --> 11:09.890
An older, practical female teacher who holds many qualifications and a mysterious personal history.

11:09.890 --> 11:12.540
He's a prince with many loves, isn't he?

11:12.970 --> 11:16.400
I think you should give up on Nozomu-kun.

11:16.730 --> 11:19.190
Obstacles in your path can only increase the love you feel.

11:19.630 --> 11:22.450
I understand your feelings so well, it hurts.

11:22.450 --> 11:24.330
Just leave everything to me.

11:24.330 --> 11:27.540
I'll make sure that your love will bear fruit!

11:27.540 --> 11:28.250
Thank you!

11:31.090 --> 11:35.380
If you can't talk to him face-to-face, then you can pour your feelings into a letter instead.

11:35.380 --> 11:40.590
We'll call it "The-love-letter-in-the-shoe-lockers-
that's-not-even-seen-in-girls'-manga-anymore plan."

11:40.590 --> 11:43.440
This is fairly orthodox for Chris-chan.

11:43.440 --> 11:44.600
Ah! He's here!

11:48.780 --> 11:49.480
Huh?

11:51.940 --> 11:59.780
Hey, what are you guys doing here? The weatherman said it'll snow tonight, so you better go straight home.

11:52.630 --> 11:54.100
He left.

11:54.130 --> 11:56.590
Didn't he notice the letter?

11:56.590 --> 11:58.310
Are you sure you put the letter in there?

11:58.310 --> 11:59.780
There's no mistake.

11:59.780 --> 12:01.170
I put it right here!

12:02.340 --> 12:05.200
Oh! A love letter!

12:05.560 --> 12:07.330
Look!

12:07.330 --> 12:10.300
Even I<i> can get a love letter!</i>

12:10.300 --> 12:11.950
I'm so happy.

12:11.950 --> 12:15.040
I should tell my pen-pal Akane-chan too!

12:15.040 --> 12:17.540
Yay!

12:17.540 --> 12:21.240
It appears Hikarigaoka-san's was the locker next door.

12:23.930 --> 12:26.110
It'll be okay this time, right?

12:27.000 --> 12:29.060
My scenario is perfect.

12:29.060 --> 12:31.230
Go! Juvenile delinquents A, B, and C!

12:31.230 --> 12:32.390
Okay!

12:32.390 --> 12:35.480
Hikarigaoka-kun will be surrounded by the delinquents and be in huge trouble!

12:35.480 --> 12:38.770
Then, you'll run in and beat them up.

12:38.770 --> 12:42.610
You'll be his savior and thus there'll be a tie binding you to him.

12:42.610 --> 12:44.750
What a perfect scenario.

12:44.750 --> 12:46.620
I'm definitely a genius!

12:49.580 --> 12:52.240
Yo, Bro! Come with us for a second!

12:52.240 --> 12:54.420
This is so embarrassing.

12:54.420 --> 12:56.150
Hey, what's wrong?

12:56.150 --> 12:57.910
Why are you all dressed up like that?

12:58.520 --> 13:03.150
I know! This must be the new fashion amongst the girls.

13:03.150 --> 13:07.630
It suits you perfectly, Hanakomachi-san, Tenchi-san, Miyu-chi.

13:07.630 --> 13:09.140
He saw right through them!

13:19.780 --> 13:23.140
How about confessing over the phone?

13:23.140 --> 13:26.790
I think you'll be able to be a bit more bold if all he can hear is your voice.

13:26.790 --> 13:29.830
I wonder if he'll be able to tell it was me by just my voice?

13:29.830 --> 13:32.850
I doubt he'll be able to since he doesn't even know your name.

13:32.850 --> 13:36.360
How about hypnotizing Nozomu-kun?

13:36.360 --> 13:38.630
You will fall in love with Guava.

13:38.630 --> 13:40.950
That's not love at all!

13:40.950 --> 13:44.500
And you tried that on Kurosu-kun before and it failed.

13:44.500 --> 13:45.400
That's true.

13:45.400 --> 13:47.840
Your opponent is just too tough.

13:48.290 --> 13:49.410
That's right!

13:49.410 --> 13:53.010
It's not a simple task to get someone like Hikarigaoka-kun,

13:53.010 --> 13:55.930
who's equally nice to all girls fall in love, right?

13:55.930 --> 13:57.900
It's okay, everyone.

13:59.340 --> 14:03.190
I'm not suited for love anyway.

14:03.190 --> 14:07.290
I'm not used to seeing handsome guys,

14:07.290 --> 14:10.160
so meeting him made me go a little crazy, that's all.

14:17.040 --> 14:22.050
I thought that perhaps Guava was forcing herself to be happy to forget about being kicked out

14:22.050 --> 14:29.010
of the Waru Waru Gang, but I think she actually does like Nozomu-kun a lot.

14:29.010 --> 14:30.010
So?

14:30.010 --> 14:31.700
You're so cold.

14:31.700 --> 14:34.540
So, I'm just thinking that we should do something to help her,

14:34.540 --> 14:37.050
but being how Nozomu-kun is...

14:37.050 --> 14:39.070
So, I was wondering what she<i> could do.</i>

14:39.070 --> 14:41.520
His personality has nothing to do with it.

14:41.860 --> 14:47.540
What's important is that you convey your true feelings

14:47.540 --> 14:50.200
without employing any silly tricks.

14:50.960 --> 14:53.040
Your true feelings...

14:54.700 --> 14:59.210
[Note: Momon Land]

14:59.530 --> 15:03.900
As expected of Hikarigaoka-kun. He wouldn't make a girl wait for him.

15:03.900 --> 15:06.460
His waiting pose is unique as well...

15:06.460 --> 15:10.860
I see, asking him out on a date without employing any silly tricks.

15:10.860 --> 15:12.940
That's a pretty good idea, Miyu.

15:12.940 --> 15:15.720
Although, I wasn't the one who suggested it originally.

15:16.160 --> 15:17.430
Come on, Guava.

15:18.560 --> 15:21.900
I'm embarrassed... I feel like I'm walking around naked.

15:21.900 --> 15:23.250
You're fine. Just fine.

15:23.250 --> 15:25.570
You look cute. Very cute.

15:25.570 --> 15:31.170
If you tell him your true feelings, I'm sure he'll accept them.

15:31.170 --> 15:31.950
Do your best!

15:34.240 --> 15:35.290
Umm...

15:36.780 --> 15:38.030
I'm sorry to keep you waiting.

15:38.680 --> 15:40.080
You're so beautiful!

15:41.050 --> 15:42.350
Thank you!

15:42.350 --> 15:45.100
Shall we go, Mademoiselle?

15:45.100 --> 15:45.670
Yes!

15:48.380 --> 15:50.250
I wonder if they'll be all right...

15:50.250 --> 15:52.110
Of course not.

15:52.110 --> 15:54.130
We're going to keep an eye on them.

16:00.290 --> 16:03.600
No matter how old you get, Momon Land is fun!

16:03.600 --> 16:05.310
Don't get too carried away now.

16:05.310 --> 16:06.770
Hey, it's Kouzuki-san and the others.

16:09.990 --> 16:12.200
It seems like it's started.

16:14.950 --> 16:19.410
Watching from afar, they do seem to make a nice couple.

16:19.410 --> 16:19.910
They certainly do.

16:19.910 --> 16:22.830
The waiting time is currently 20 minutes.

16:23.960 --> 16:32.720
Mademoiselle, as long as I can see your smile, I could wait for hours even in the rain.

16:32.720 --> 16:36.300
This is a modest thank you from me.

16:38.850 --> 16:39.350
Over here!

16:39.630 --> 16:42.550
Mademoiselle, are you thirsty?

16:42.550 --> 16:44.490
Should I go buy us something?

16:44.490 --> 16:46.810
No, I should definitely go and buy us something.

16:46.810 --> 16:48.210
Drinks!

16:48.210 --> 16:48.860
Yes.

16:48.860 --> 16:51.300
Would anyone care for some juice?

16:51.300 --> 16:54.170
Excuse me, I'd like two juices and...

16:54.170 --> 16:54.990
Yes?

16:55.660 --> 16:58.080
Your smile to go.

16:58.950 --> 16:59.560
Over here!

17:00.860 --> 17:03.100
My balloon flew away!

17:03.100 --> 17:06.170
Now, don't cry anymore. Here's a rose for you.

17:06.170 --> 17:10.090
Here, a rose for a beautiful lady, Mademoiselle!

17:11.060 --> 17:12.340
Prince...

17:12.340 --> 17:14.630
Ah! I'm tired.

17:14.630 --> 17:16.740
I think he's rude.

17:16.740 --> 17:19.890
Paying attention to other girls in the middle of a date...

17:19.890 --> 17:24.890
Ah! I feel like I hear a voice criticizing me from somewhere.

17:25.250 --> 17:30.400
But of course, I've got to be nice to all the girls all the time.

17:31.000 --> 17:36.660
I'm sorry, Mademoiselle. I can't stay with a single girl for more than 15 minutes,

17:37.070 --> 17:44.750
because if one girl has a monopoly on my love, all the other girls in the world will be unhappy!

17:44.750 --> 17:46.030
That's right...

17:46.030 --> 17:49.210
Hikarigaoka-kun's personality is like that, isn't it?

17:49.210 --> 17:51.710
Even if you're like that, it's fine with me.

17:52.920 --> 17:56.670
I'm just happy to be by your side

17:56.670 --> 18:00.600
because you're my prince.

18:00.600 --> 18:03.560
Oh, Guava-chi.

18:04.310 --> 18:08.420
What a beautiful heart you have.

18:08.420 --> 18:09.670
My prince...

18:15.280 --> 18:18.080
I don't really understand it, but things seem to be going well.

18:18.080 --> 18:20.370
Yup. Yup. Do your best Guava!

18:25.580 --> 18:27.580
Just now...

18:34.000 --> 18:37.470
Jeez, how long are you planning to make us wait?!

18:37.470 --> 18:39.360
Doria-neechan?

18:39.360 --> 18:42.970
I'm so tired of waiting my neck's become elongated as a result!

18:42.970 --> 18:44.160
What?

18:44.160 --> 18:45.700
I think I've seen her somewhere before...

18:45.700 --> 18:47.150
The Waru Waru Gang!

18:47.150 --> 18:51.440
Warawara... Wariwari... Waruwaru...

18:51.440 --> 18:53.870
Who are they, Guava-chi?

18:54.360 --> 18:56.720
This is... um...

18:56.720 --> 18:58.740
Ah! This is so irritating!

18:59.040 --> 19:02.620
When are you going to kidnap that baby from planet Otto?!

19:03.550 --> 19:04.390
Kidnap?

19:04.390 --> 19:05.830
Kidnap?!

19:05.830 --> 19:06.990
Miyu-chi?

19:06.990 --> 19:07.790
Everyone!

19:07.790 --> 19:09.930
What do you mean by kidnap?

19:09.930 --> 19:12.110
It's a plan that Doria-neechan thought up.

19:12.110 --> 19:14.410
In order to drop your guard, she wanted you to believe that

19:14.410 --> 19:16.750
Guava got kicked out of the Waru Waru Gang, so that we could kidnap the baby.

19:16.750 --> 19:21.300
It's called "They didn't seem like someone who would do something so evil plan."

19:21.600 --> 19:22.510
Guava-chi?

19:22.510 --> 19:24.270
That's a lie, right, Guava?

19:24.270 --> 19:25.830
I'm sorry.

19:25.830 --> 19:28.590
Guava-chi, what's the meaning of this?

19:28.590 --> 19:29.850
My prince...

19:29.850 --> 19:31.620
What are you doing, Guava?!

19:31.620 --> 19:33.060
Where's the baby?!

19:33.530 --> 19:38.070
I started going along with the plan at first, but...

19:38.290 --> 19:44.360
But seeing how everyone's so kind to me and being able to go on a date with my prince...

19:44.360 --> 19:47.410
I completely forgot about the plan.

19:48.490 --> 19:52.330
But in the end, I'm a member of the Waru Waru Gang.

19:52.330 --> 19:55.380
The world I live in is so different from my prince's.

19:55.380 --> 19:59.510
If I stay here any longer, I'll just cause more trouble for my prince.

19:59.510 --> 20:00.920
Miyu!

20:00.920 --> 20:01.920
Kanata!

20:01.920 --> 20:03.930
I saw a UFO flying, so...

20:08.390 --> 20:09.140
Ruu!

20:09.140 --> 20:10.730
Guava! What are you doing?!

20:13.190 --> 20:16.310
I'm the third sister of the Waru Waru Gang, Guava!

20:16.310 --> 20:19.070
I got close to you in order to kidnap this baby!

20:19.070 --> 20:21.560
Then, are you saying you were lying about everything?!

20:21.560 --> 20:23.530
Even your feelings about Nozomu-kun?

20:25.520 --> 20:29.810
I'm a member of the evil Waru Waru Gang that's active all over space!

20:29.810 --> 20:33.060
I'm not that<i> bored that I have time to worry about love!</i>

20:33.640 --> 20:35.080
Guava-chi...

20:36.440 --> 20:37.270
This is bad.

20:37.270 --> 20:40.340
There are so many onlookers here, we won't be able to fool-

20:40.340 --> 20:41.840
[Note: Hero Show: Pukupuku Man]

20:41.840 --> 20:44.110
Wanya! Transform into that!

20:44.110 --> 20:45.270
What? But...

20:45.270 --> 20:46.680
Just do it!

20:46.680 --> 20:48.560
If anything goes wrong, I'm not responsible...

20:49.240 --> 20:51.270
This is the end for you, villains!

20:53.320 --> 20:55.810
I'm the warrior of love and freedom!

20:55.810 --> 20:57.480
Pukupuku Man 7!

20:57.480 --> 21:00.190
Waru Waru Gang, today, I won't forgive you!

21:00.190 --> 21:02.380
Doria-neechan!

21:02.380 --> 21:03.700
Don't be afraid!

21:03.700 --> 21:05.360
We have a hostage!

21:05.360 --> 21:08.470
Take this blow of justice! Pukupuku Attack!

21:09.500 --> 21:11.350
The Pukupuku Attack!

21:11.350 --> 21:13.950
Pukupuku Attack!

21:19.900 --> 21:20.960
Glasses... glasses...

21:25.660 --> 21:27.390
How's that, Waru Waru Gang?!

21:27.390 --> 21:28.200
Do you give up?!

21:28.990 --> 21:31.140
We'll remember this!

21:33.160 --> 21:34.330
Guava-chi...

21:36.590 --> 21:39.380
Goodbye, my prince.

21:41.680 --> 21:43.280
Justice will always prevail!

21:43.280 --> 21:45.730
Thank you, Pukupuku Man 7!

21:45.730 --> 21:48.650
The shows nowadays sure have improved a lot.

21:48.650 --> 21:50.330
Thank you. Thank you.

21:50.330 --> 21:52.920
Seems like we were able to fool them.

21:52.920 --> 21:53.830
Kanata!

21:53.830 --> 21:56.530
Hey, Miyu! What was that all about?!

21:56.530 --> 21:57.870
What's going on?

21:57.870 --> 21:59.380
Or not...

21:59.770 --> 22:01.890
Is it possible... Is it possible?!

22:01.890 --> 22:03.690
Are we on Candid Camera?

22:03.690 --> 22:08.560
This was all Miyu's plan to get Hikarigaoka-kun, right?

22:08.560 --> 22:09.660
Umm...

22:09.660 --> 22:11.580
Oh, so that's how it is.

22:11.580 --> 22:13.310
Let's just leave it as that.

22:18.260 --> 22:19.490
Nozomu-kun?

22:20.230 --> 22:24.460
Is it possible that you were serious about Guava?

22:24.460 --> 22:25.960
What are you talking about?

22:25.960 --> 22:28.240
I'm always serious.

22:28.570 --> 22:32.700
Hello, Mademoiselle, would you like to ride the ferris wheel with me?

22:32.700 --> 22:36.180
I feel silly for worrying now.

22:36.180 --> 22:37.250
I wonder?

22:37.250 --> 22:37.750
What?

22:37.750 --> 22:39.920
No, it's nothing.

22:48.050 --> 22:53.680
Wanya's diary: For the first time in a long while, we went to Momon Land.

22:53.680 --> 22:57.170
Ruu-chama saw a hero show and was very happy.

22:57.170 --> 22:59.630
Guava, is dinner ready yet?!

22:59.630 --> 23:00.770
It's almost done!

23:00.770 --> 23:05.400
By the way, a red rose means passion,

23:05.400 --> 23:09.940
but a white rose means true love.

23:09.940 --> 23:12.390
It was written in one of Earth's books.

23:12.390 --> 23:16.740
I'm learning so much. I'm so capable.

24:29.940 --> 24:59.960
Next Episode

24:32.410 --> 24:35.880
Chris-chan is worrying about what she's going to get Momoka-chan for Christmas.

24:35.880 --> 24:38.120
That's a difficult problem.

24:38.120 --> 24:39.580
Isn't there anything she wants?

24:39.580 --> 24:41.080
I've thought of something good!

24:41.080 --> 24:42.910
If everyone cooperates, we can do it!

24:42.910 --> 24:45.730
Next time on Daa Daa Daa: Momoka's Christmas.

24:45.730 --> 24:47.700
Kanata has to help too, okay?

24:47.700 --> 24:50.010
It's starting to look like Christmas.

24:51.050 --> 24:53.930
Momoka wants to fly in Santa's sleigh!

24:53.930 --> 24:55.140
We can do it!

24:53.930 --> 24:59.960
Momoka's Christmas

24:54.940 --> 24:56.040
What?
